Tommy Lagerman is an eight-year-old human boy from [[Geography/Calaria/Wrenford|Wrenford]]. He wears shorts and a graphic tee and carries a backpack with a water bottle hanging from the side. He wears a faint rainbow-colored raiment of the [[Iridescent Host|Host]]. He can see in the dark and is not afraid of it. His mother is [[People/Karen Lagerman|Karen Lagerman]], and he lives at home with her.

A friend named Jonathan once dared him to walk into the [[Verdant Expanse]] for an hour. He got lost, was attacked by a tree, and ended up in a clearing deep in the forest with his ankle caught in a branch. He believes he walked only an hour, though he was in the forest for days and many days' travel from any settlement, and he did not look as though he had made the trek. Under questioning from [[Org/Iridescent Church/Convox/Magical Crimes/People/Cedric Corot|Cedric Corot]] he did not seem to be lying.

He talks about the Ghost Festival, a Halian custom in which children go door to door and are given guns. He was told the [[Green Father|Green Man]] is not real. He likes the investigators and their drawings and beef jerky, and [[Org/Iridescent Church/Convox/Magical Crimes/People/Cedric Corot|Cedric]] made him a deputy.
